comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-16T10:47:21.375Z",codex-sol,"Run 43707381451 exits 1 in setup before import: the node -e guard compares the installed package version to PM_GITHUB_VERSION and calls process.exit(1) without a diagnostic. The requested version is 2026.11.02; npm installs 2026.11.2. Current main already includes merged PR #20 pinning pm-github 2026.11.15, which normalizes the version and reports a mismatch explicitly. The current pinned gated dry-run passes: 1 planned, 0 skipped, 1 new. No workflow dispatch or GitHub issue mutation is needed."
  "2026-11-16T11:02:04.230Z",codex-sol,"Initial review receipt: the failed workflow log and current pin are documented in docs/issue-sync-2026-11-16.md. Seeded tracker validation passes through pm test --run --progress. Typecheck and lint pass. The quick package suite remains running under shared-host load; no complete passing suite is claimed.   Publish review evidence with pending gates explicit; no scheduled success is claimed."
